        {
          "text": "Kwatandite soni ngondo ku Gati, kwele kwapali mundu jwamlewu jwakwete mwigasa lililyose yala msano ni cimo, mlusajo lulilose nombe lwakwete yala msano ni cimo, yosope pampepe yaliji makumi gaŵili ni mcece. Soni jwaliji jumo jwa yisukulu ya Lafa. ",
